---
description: Testing and verification conventions
globs: "src/**/*.test.{ts,tsx}, scripts/**/*.mjs, .github/workflows/*.yml"
alwaysApply: false
---
- Test failure paths, resume behavior, configuration precedence, and cross-platform process assumptions.
- Prefer deterministic tests over spawning real paid AI harnesses.
- Keep mocked adapter tests separate from true harness preflight checks.
- All unit and CLI tests are hermetic and run completely offline without AI credentials or network dependencies.
- Tests discover compiled `.test.js` files originating from both `.test.ts` and `.test.tsx` under `dist/`.
- `npm run test:unit` ensures build freshness by cleaning and compiling prior to running tests.
- `npm run test:coverage` runs Node test runner with `--experimental-test-coverage`.
- Run `npm run verify` before completing code changes.
